1
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,650
Wealth, fame, power...

2
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:07,820
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,
obtained everything the world has to offer.

3
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:11,660
What he said in his final moments
drove countless souls to the seas.

4
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:13,660
You want my treasure?

5
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:15,450
Go ahead.

6
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:16,660
Find it!

7
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:19,250
Everything is right where I left it!

8
00:00:21,670 --> 00:00:26,380
People set their sights on the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams.

9
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:29,630
The world has truly entered
the Great Pirate Era!

10
00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:54,710
I'm starving...

11
00:01:54,710 --> 00:01:57,470
When the hell are
we gonna reach land?

12
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:58,600
Enter: Nami

13
00:01:57,470 --> 00:02:01,850
Who knows. We're just floating
with the wind and waves, after all...

14
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:05,520
Isn't it a little weird
that the future Pirate King

15
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:08,020
doesn't have a shred
of navigational skills?!

16
00:02:08,020 --> 00:02:11,110
It's not weird.
I've just been drifting about.

17
00:02:11,110 --> 00:02:15,280
But aren't you a bounty hunter
who also wandered on the high seas?

18
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:19,030
I don't recall ever saying
I was a bounty hunter.

19
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:23,450
I set out to sea
in search of a certain man

20
00:02:23,450 --> 00:02:25,580
but then couldn't
get back to my village.

21
00:02:26,460 --> 00:02:30,040
Eventually, I just went
after pirate ships to earn a living.

22
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:31,830
Oh. So you got lost.

23
00:02:31,830 --> 00:02:33,630
Don't put it like that!

24
00:02:42,010 --> 00:02:43,810
Another big haul today!

25
00:02:43,810 --> 00:02:46,720
Captain Buggy won't be mad at us
now that we got all this!

26
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:48,100
Huh?

27
00:02:48,100 --> 00:02:49,810
Hey, check it out...

28
00:02:54,020 --> 00:02:55,860
What's with that boat?

29
00:03:09,330 --> 00:03:10,830
I-It's a girl!

30
00:03:11,750 --> 00:03:13,540
Hey! What's wrong with you?

31
00:03:15,550 --> 00:03:19,170
Oh! Am I dreaming?

32
00:03:19,170 --> 00:03:22,260
Running into someone
on this wide open sea...

33
00:03:22,260 --> 00:03:25,100
I-I don't know who you are,
but... water...

34
00:03:25,100 --> 00:03:27,470
Can I get a drink of water?

35
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:29,930
I'll give you all the money you'd like.

36
00:03:29,930 --> 00:03:31,940
Please, help me!

37
00:03:32,730 --> 00:03:34,900
No problem! We'll help you!

38
00:03:34,900 --> 00:03:38,280
But not until we see
that treasure of yours!

39
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,940
Don't mind us!

40
00:03:43,780 --> 00:03:46,740
I can't get it open...
How about this?

41
00:03:52,210 --> 00:03:55,670
If you'd like, you can
keep the whole boat!

42
00:03:56,340 --> 00:03:58,090
Our boat!

43
00:03:58,090 --> 00:03:59,680
You tricked us!

44
00:04:02,510 --> 00:04:06,350
A cold front accompanied by low
clouds spotted in the southern sky!

45
00:04:06,350 --> 00:04:09,640
Intense winds and squalls
expected very soon!

46
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:12,230
Small vessels, take
precautions not to capsize.

47
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:25,660
Bingo!

48
00:04:26,660 --> 00:04:27,620
See ya!

49
00:04:27,620 --> 00:04:30,620
I'll just help myself to your treasure!

50
00:04:30,620 --> 00:04:32,580
Wait! You bitch!

51
00:04:32,580 --> 00:04:35,000
We'll get you for this...

52
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:38,250
Man, I'm hungry.

53
00:04:41,090 --> 00:04:42,340
A bird...?

54
00:04:43,130 --> 00:04:44,760
Let's eat it!

55
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:46,760
Huh? How?

56
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,930
Leave it to me!

57
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:50,970
Gum-Gum...

58
00:04:50,970 --> 00:04:52,430
Rocket!

59
00:04:53,640 --> 00:04:55,100
Oh. That's how.

60
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:04,740
Help!

61
00:05:04,740 --> 00:05:07,320
Moron! What the hell are you doing?!

62
00:05:12,500 --> 00:05:16,820
Hey! Stop! You there! Stop!

63
00:05:16,820 --> 00:05:19,280
Shipwreck survivors,
at a time like this?!

64
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:22,330
I can't stop! Jump in on your own!

65
00:05:22,330 --> 00:05:24,070
What?!

66
00:05:26,790 --> 00:05:28,760
Good job, you made it!

67
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:30,160
Were you trying to hit us?!

68
00:05:30,540 --> 00:05:32,660
Hey! Stop the boat!

69
00:05:32,660 --> 00:05:36,640
We're members of the great
Buggy the Clown's crew!

70
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:38,000
This boat is ours now!

71
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:40,500
Huh?!

72
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:46,420
We had no idea you were
the famous Pirate Hunter Zoro!

73
00:05:46,420 --> 00:05:48,320
Forgive our rudeness!

74
00:05:48,990 --> 00:05:51,950
You bastards made me
lose sight of my friend.

75
00:05:51,950 --> 00:05:53,450
Just keep rowing!

76
00:05:53,450 --> 00:05:54,660
Yessir!

77
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:58,980
Knowing Luffy, he'll manage
something once he spots land.

78
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:03,710
But still... What do we do now, Bro?

79
00:06:03,710 --> 00:06:05,130
Good question...

80
00:06:05,130 --> 00:06:10,430
If Captain Buggy finds out some girl
stole our boat and treasure...

81
00:06:10,430 --> 00:06:11,930
Yeah...

82
00:06:11,930 --> 00:06:13,970
Who's this Buggy guy?

83
00:06:13,970 --> 00:06:16,350
You've never heard
of Buggy the Clown?!

84
00:06:16,350 --> 00:06:17,970
Nope.

85
00:06:17,970 --> 00:06:21,060
He's the captain of our crew!

86
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:27,320
He ate a devil fruit and is
about as terrifying as they come!

87
00:06:45,300 --> 00:06:47,760
Yes! I finally got it!

88
00:06:49,300 --> 00:06:52,030
– Get back here, you wench!
– Hey, girl! That's our map!

89
00:06:52,030 --> 00:06:56,540
We just stole that map
to the Grand Line!

90
00:06:56,540 --> 00:06:59,940
Dammit! If we don't get it back,
we're dead meat!

91
00:06:59,940 --> 00:07:02,480
I'd hate to be a target
for the captain's cannonballs!

92
00:07:07,150 --> 00:07:10,820
Captain Buggy! I see something
in the sky above the port!

93
00:07:11,570 --> 00:07:12,910
Shoot it down!

94
00:07:19,540 --> 00:07:20,620
Wh-What the...?

95
00:07:30,930 --> 00:07:32,430
Wh-What?!

96
00:07:32,430 --> 00:07:34,100
What was that?!

97
00:07:34,100 --> 00:07:35,890
A person fell from the sky!

98
00:07:35,890 --> 00:07:40,100
Dammit! Why's someone
shooting cannonballs at me?!

99
00:07:45,150 --> 00:07:46,820
But now I'm free!

100
00:07:46,820 --> 00:07:49,940
That was a pretty cool trip!

101
00:07:54,530 --> 00:07:56,700
I'm starving...

102
00:07:55,370 --> 00:07:56,700
B-Boss!

103
00:07:56,700 --> 00:07:58,450
You came to save me!

104
00:07:58,450 --> 00:07:59,000
Huh?

105
00:08:00,370 --> 00:08:01,210
Who are you?

106
00:08:03,620 --> 00:08:06,290
Sorry, but they're all yours now!

107
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,210
Hey! She's getting away!

108
00:08:10,210 --> 00:08:12,930
That's okay! Her boss is right here!

109
00:08:12,930 --> 00:08:16,850
Oh, I see! Covering for
your lackey, huh?!

110
00:08:16,850 --> 00:08:19,470
Say, is there any place
to eat around here?

111
00:08:19,470 --> 00:08:21,480
Quit screwing around, kid!

112
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:32,610
Don't touch my treasure!

113
00:08:32,610 --> 00:08:34,360
You bastard!

114
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:36,490
Wonder if they killed that guy...

115
00:08:37,450 --> 00:08:39,830
Gum-Gum Pistol!

116
00:08:46,170 --> 00:08:48,210
Wow!

117
00:08:48,210 --> 00:08:49,960
You're pretty tough!

118
00:08:53,090 --> 00:08:55,840
They had sabers,
but you knocked them flat!

119
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:58,850
Hey! You're the one who...!
Who are you?

120
00:08:58,850 --> 00:09:01,890
I'm a thief who steals from pirates!

121
00:08:58,930 --> 00:09:05,040
Nami, the Pirate Thief

122
00:09:01,890 --> 00:09:03,020
The name's Nami!

123
00:09:03,020 --> 00:09:05,020
Hey, wanna team up?!

124
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:08,480
Nope. I don't wanna
team up with you.

125
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:11,070
W-W-Wait!

126
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,940
Wait, I said!

127
00:09:16,030 --> 00:09:19,280
They still haven't caught the thief?!

128
00:09:20,410 --> 00:09:25,750
Th-They should be pursuing her
as we speak, Captain Buggy! Yes!

129
00:09:25,790 --> 00:09:31,550
Buggy "the Clown"
Pirate Captain

130
00:09:26,580 --> 00:09:31,550
How'd she steal the map so easily?! Huh?!

131
00:09:32,710 --> 00:09:37,550
Just when we were about to enter
the Grand Line to cause some chaos!

132
00:09:38,090 --> 00:09:42,810
A-Actually, someone forgot
to close the shack by mistake.

133
00:09:43,770 --> 00:09:44,600
What did you say?!

134
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:47,230
I-I said: someone forgot
to close the shack by mistake.

135
00:09:47,230 --> 00:09:50,440
Whose nose is tacky 'n fake?!

136
00:09:52,070 --> 00:09:56,360
Do you find this nose funny?!
Just like a fake nose?!

137
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:58,410
Th-That's not what I said at all!

138
00:09:58,410 --> 00:10:00,870
It's like a huge red ball?!

139
00:10:02,950 --> 00:10:04,700
Help!

140
00:10:10,750 --> 00:10:12,340
H-Here it comes...

141
00:10:12,340 --> 00:10:14,460
H-His devil fruit power...

142
00:10:20,850 --> 00:10:22,390
Who am I?

143
00:10:23,350 --> 00:10:25,600
C-Captain Buggy...

144
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:33,270
What happens to mutineers?

145
00:10:33,270 --> 00:10:36,190
A flashy death awaits them...

146
00:10:36,190 --> 00:10:38,610
Please forgive me!

147
00:10:38,610 --> 00:10:40,740
I'll never say it again!

148
00:10:41,660 --> 00:10:43,780
Please forgive me!

149
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:50,500
I'll overlook your verbal slipup
and forgive you just this once.

150
00:10:51,830 --> 00:10:53,500
Now get that map back!

151
00:10:53,500 --> 00:10:56,010
And if you screw up...!
Well, you know the rest.

152
00:10:56,010 --> 00:10:58,260
Aye, aye, Captain Buggy!

153
00:11:03,760 --> 00:11:05,010
Yum!

154
00:11:05,010 --> 00:11:07,350
Do you live alone in this house?

155
00:11:07,350 --> 00:11:10,440
I don't live in this town.

156
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:14,400
Everyone here ran away
because of Buggy.

157
00:11:14,400 --> 00:11:16,860
So you're just a petty thief.

158
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:16,860
How rude!

159
00:11:16,860 --> 00:11:19,900
I'm a thief who
only steals from pirates!

160
00:11:19,900 --> 00:11:22,280
Don't compare me
to some common thief!

161
00:11:23,660 --> 00:11:25,620
But a thief's a thief.

162
00:11:26,910 --> 00:11:31,620
My goal is to earn 100 million belly,
no matter what it takes.

163
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:35,290
What do you need that much for?

164
00:11:35,290 --> 00:11:36,210
It's a secret!

165
00:11:37,090 --> 00:11:41,680
But with a map to the Grand Line,
100 million is a real possibility!

166
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:45,470
A map? Are you a navigator?!

167
00:11:46,180 --> 00:11:49,100
Much more skilled
than your average navigator!

168
00:11:50,020 --> 00:11:55,020
Oh, that's perfect!
Do you wanna be our navigator?!

169
00:11:55,020 --> 00:11:56,070
Really?

170
00:11:56,070 --> 00:11:58,480
Yeah! Our new pirate crew member!

171
00:11:59,150 --> 00:11:59,990
No!

172
00:12:02,280 --> 00:12:04,110
So you're a pirate?

173
00:12:04,110 --> 00:12:08,540
Yeah. I swore to the person
who gave me this straw hat

174
00:12:08,540 --> 00:12:10,790
that I'd gather a crew
and become a pirate!

175
00:12:11,870 --> 00:12:14,830
There's nothing I hate more
in this world than pirates!

176
00:12:14,830 --> 00:12:16,530
I only like money and tangerines!

177
00:12:16,530 --> 00:12:18,880
Hey. You gotta be our navigator.

178
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:20,800
I said no.

179
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:22,130
No, huh?

180
00:12:23,630 --> 00:12:27,100
Hey! You find her?!

181
00:12:25,140 --> 00:12:27,100
Can't find her anywhere!

182
00:12:27,100 --> 00:12:29,350
Where'd that girl thief go?!

183
00:12:29,350 --> 00:12:31,850
We're in trouble
if we don't get that map back!

184
00:12:32,850 --> 00:12:36,810
I gotta do something about them.

185
00:12:36,810 --> 00:12:41,030
Well, I might consider it
if you agree to certain conditions!

186
00:12:41,030 --> 00:12:43,110
Really?! I'll do anything!

187
00:12:43,530 --> 00:12:47,410
I want you to come with me
to see a pirate named Buggy.

188
00:12:47,410 --> 00:12:48,120
But...

189
00:12:52,370 --> 00:12:53,710
Why am I tied up?

190
00:12:53,710 --> 00:12:56,330
It's just rope. Is there a problem?

191
00:12:56,330 --> 00:13:00,920
Nah! I was hoping to meet
other pirates! Let's go!

192
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:03,050
Hold on, now!

193
00:13:03,050 --> 00:13:05,840
What?!

194
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:07,890
The thief got away?!

195
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:11,640
Please forgive us, Captain!

196
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:16,020
All three of you are pathetic!
Now die with some flashy flair!

197
00:13:17,280 --> 00:13:18,520
Captain Buggy!

198
00:13:19,570 --> 00:13:20,560
What is it?!

199
00:13:20,560 --> 00:13:23,600
That thief from earlier
came back on her own!

200
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:24,480
What?!

201
00:13:29,040 --> 00:13:30,320
That's them!

202
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:33,120
She's the one who stole the map!

203
00:13:37,660 --> 00:13:41,190
I've captured your thief,
Captain Buggy the Clown!

204
00:13:41,190 --> 00:13:42,590
Here's your map back!

205
00:13:42,590 --> 00:13:45,100
I appreciate it.

206
00:13:45,100 --> 00:13:47,560
But why the change of heart?

207
00:13:50,010 --> 00:13:54,040
My boss and I had a fight.
I'm fed up with him!

208
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:56,390
Please let me join your crew!

209
00:14:03,950 --> 00:14:05,530
Fed up, huh?

210
00:14:05,530 --> 00:14:07,160
Girl, you're my kind of flashy!

211
00:14:07,160 --> 00:14:10,120
I like you! You can join my crew!

212
00:14:14,170 --> 00:14:15,860
Infiltration successful!

213
00:14:15,860 --> 00:14:18,570
Pirates are so dumb
and easy to manipulate!

214
00:14:21,500 --> 00:14:23,420
Why am I in a cage?

215
00:14:26,090 --> 00:14:28,010
I feel great today!

216
00:14:28,010 --> 00:14:30,300
Girl! What name do you go by?

217
00:14:30,300 --> 00:14:31,390
Nami!

218
00:14:31,390 --> 00:14:35,440
Fantastic! Let's hold
a welcome party for Nami here!

219
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:36,640
And make it flashy!

220
00:14:54,580 --> 00:14:57,380
What's wrong?!
This celebration's in your honor!

221
00:14:57,380 --> 00:14:59,660
Eat up!

222
00:14:59,660 --> 00:15:01,500
Yes! Thank you!

223
00:15:02,530 --> 00:15:06,420
Just gotta find the right moment
to take back the map.

224
00:15:06,420 --> 00:15:10,180
While I'm at it, maybe I'll swipe
all of Buggy's treasure too!

225
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:14,090
Dammit!

226
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:25,690
The flashy greatness of this is clear!

227
00:15:25,690 --> 00:15:30,700
Men! Prepare a Special Buggy Ball!

228
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:49,900
All set, sir!

229
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:53,350
Wh-What's about to happen?

230
00:15:53,350 --> 00:15:56,330
Observe the might of the Buggy Ball!

231
00:15:56,330 --> 00:15:57,180
Light it.

232
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:21,370
What's that explosion?

233
00:16:21,370 --> 00:16:25,180
It's one of our captain's
beloved Buggy Balls!

234
00:16:25,180 --> 00:16:27,000
Buggy Balls?!

235
00:16:38,810 --> 00:16:40,390
Truly flashy!

236
00:16:40,390 --> 00:16:42,390
With Buggy Balls and my devil fruit,

237
00:16:42,390 --> 00:16:45,600
the Grand Line will be
mine for the taking!

238
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:46,770
Right, Nami?!

239
00:16:46,770 --> 00:16:48,650
Y-Yes! Of course!

240
00:16:48,650 --> 00:16:50,240
What?!

241
00:16:51,280 --> 00:16:53,950
But I'm the one who will
take over the Grand Line!

242
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:55,870
What?

243
00:16:55,870 --> 00:16:58,280
I'm gonna be King of the Pirates!

244
00:16:58,570 --> 00:17:00,260
You idiot!

245
00:17:03,440 --> 00:17:05,750
I see why you're sick of him, Nami!

246
00:17:05,750 --> 00:17:07,400
Y-You got that right!

247
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:10,590
He takes the world too lightly
and misunderstands everything!

248
00:17:10,590 --> 00:17:13,130
I couldn't put up with it anymore.

249
00:17:13,130 --> 00:17:14,130
Naturally!

250
00:17:14,130 --> 00:17:19,010
Well then, take a Buggy Ball
and blow your old boss to smithereens!

251
00:17:20,600 --> 00:17:25,500
It'll also prove your loyalty to me.

252
00:17:25,500 --> 00:17:26,140
Do it!

253
00:17:34,110 --> 00:17:35,880
N-No, that's okay!

254
00:17:35,880 --> 00:17:39,990
C'mon, this is a welcoming party!
Let's get back to the fun!

255
00:17:41,300 --> 00:17:44,420
Do it. This is my style
of welcoming party.

256
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:51,550
Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!

257
00:17:51,550 --> 00:17:58,510
Fire! Fire! Fire!
Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!

258
00:17:59,430 --> 00:18:02,040
If I don't shoot, I'll be killed!

259
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:07,410
But if I do shoot,
I'm no better than a pirate.

260
00:18:08,860 --> 00:18:11,530
Now light it with some flashy style!

261
00:18:11,530 --> 00:18:16,400
Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!

262
00:18:16,400 --> 00:18:19,280
Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!

263
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:23,620
Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!

264
00:18:23,630 --> 00:18:26,500
Nami! Don't wimp out on me now!

265
00:18:29,350 --> 00:18:30,330
You okay?

266
00:18:30,780 --> 00:18:32,130
Your hands are shaking!

267
00:18:33,780 --> 00:18:38,860
This is what happens when you don't
have the guts to take on pirates.

268
00:18:38,860 --> 00:18:40,400
The guts to do what?

269
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:44,350
To murder in cold blood?!
Is that what it means to be a pirate?!

270
00:18:44,350 --> 00:18:45,900
No!

271
00:18:48,350 --> 00:18:51,050
The guts to put your life on the line!

272
00:18:51,050 --> 00:18:57,600
Fire! Fire! Fire!
Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!

273
00:18:57,600 --> 00:19:00,400
Hey, new chick! Quit being a tease!

274
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:02,200
This is how you light it!

275
00:19:20,050 --> 00:19:21,760
Crap! I didn't mean to...

276
00:19:22,950 --> 00:19:26,060
Nami! What's the meaning of this?!

277
00:19:26,060 --> 00:19:27,520
I'm sorry!

278
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:30,270
What?! Apologizing won't fix things!

279
00:19:30,270 --> 00:19:33,960
What's with you?
Now you're saving me?

280
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:35,280
Don't be dense!

281
00:19:35,280 --> 00:19:38,040
The situation called for this!

282
00:19:38,040 --> 00:19:41,560
I just didn't want to wind up
like these low-life pirates!

283
00:19:41,560 --> 00:19:43,250
Oh, the situation!

284
00:19:43,250 --> 00:19:45,830
Pirates took the life
of someone dear to me!

285
00:19:45,830 --> 00:19:47,730
As if I'd ever be one!

286
00:19:47,730 --> 00:19:50,580
Oh, so that's why... Huh?

287
00:19:51,890 --> 00:19:53,590
It's lit!

288
00:19:54,540 --> 00:19:57,880
Keep your ridicule to a minimum, girl!

289
00:19:57,880 --> 00:19:59,340
Give her a flashy death!

290
00:19:59,340 --> 00:20:01,130
Yahoo!

291
00:20:03,800 --> 00:20:07,580
– A flashy death!
– A flashy death!

292
00:20:07,580 --> 00:20:08,740
– C'mon!
– Get her!

293
00:20:10,350 --> 00:20:11,770
Water! Water! Water! Water!

294
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:18,110
Not good!

295
00:20:25,300 --> 00:20:26,370
You're...

296
00:20:31,660 --> 00:20:32,630
Behind you!

297
00:20:32,630 --> 00:20:34,080
Flashy death!

298
00:20:40,520 --> 00:20:42,470
Hey, now...

299
00:20:43,530 --> 00:20:46,970
How many goons are needed
to take down just one girl, I wonder?

300
00:20:48,350 --> 00:20:49,180
Zoro!

301
00:20:55,370 --> 00:20:56,220
You hurt?

302
00:20:57,020 --> 00:20:57,810
N-N...

303
00:20:57,820 --> 00:20:59,900
Are you hurt?

304
00:20:59,900 --> 00:21:02,650
N-No, I'm fine.

305
00:21:02,650 --> 00:21:04,800
Whew, what a relief!

306
00:21:04,800 --> 00:21:08,320
How'd you find us?
Hurry and get me outta here!

307
00:21:08,320 --> 00:21:11,120
Why are you always
just messing around?

308
00:21:11,120 --> 00:21:14,210
First some bird flies off with you,
and now you're in a cage?

309
00:21:14,210 --> 00:21:16,500
It was a pretty cool trip, actually.

310
00:21:16,500 --> 00:21:18,210
"Zoro"?

311
00:21:18,210 --> 00:21:20,970
Th-That's what he
just called him, right?

312
00:21:21,360 --> 00:21:26,550
The crew member he mentioned...
was Pirate Hunter Zoro?

313
00:21:26,550 --> 00:21:28,980
What's going on?!

314
00:21:29,550 --> 00:21:30,980
So you're Zoro?

315
00:21:32,090 --> 00:21:33,420
What do you want?

316
00:21:33,420 --> 00:21:35,370
Are you after my head or something?

317
00:21:36,110 --> 00:21:41,220
Nope. Not interested.
I gave up pirate-hunting.

318
00:21:42,190 --> 00:21:45,690
I'm interested, though!
Killing you should boost my rep!

319
00:21:47,150 --> 00:21:49,400
I wouldn't try it. You'll die.

320
00:21:49,400 --> 00:21:52,120
Oh? That so?

321
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:56,620
Guess words aren't enough for you...

322
00:21:57,790 --> 00:21:59,530
Get 'im, Captain!

323
00:21:59,530 --> 00:22:02,130
Captain Buggy!

324
00:22:02,130 --> 00:22:05,090
Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!

325
00:22:05,090 --> 00:22:10,050
Buggy! Buggy!
Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!

326
00:22:10,050 --> 00:22:14,100
Buggy! Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!

327
00:22:14,100 --> 00:22:16,050
Buggy! Buggy!

328
00:22:16,050 --> 00:22:19,030
A flashy death for you!

329
00:22:38,500 --> 00:22:40,720
I cut him almost too easily...

330
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:44,140
Whoa! He was no match...!

331
00:22:44,140 --> 00:22:45,660
No way...

332
00:22:55,990 --> 00:22:57,400
What's with them?

333
00:22:57,400 --> 00:23:02,230
Wh-Why are they...? Their captain's
been killed, but they're laughing!

334
00:23:02,230 --> 00:23:05,500
Hey! What's so damn funny?!

335
00:23:13,920 --> 00:23:14,960
Zoro!

336
00:23:16,240 --> 00:23:17,850
Is that an arm?!

337
00:23:17,850 --> 00:23:20,140
What the hell?!

338
00:23:23,640 --> 00:23:26,600
The Part-Part Fruit.

339
00:23:26,600 --> 00:23:30,040
That's the name of the devil fruit I ate!

340
00:23:31,710 --> 00:23:35,720
No one can cut me!
I'm able to partition myself!

341
00:23:38,570 --> 00:23:41,120
His body parts reassembled!

342
00:23:41,120 --> 00:23:44,560
I thought the devil fruits
were only myths!

343
00:23:44,560 --> 00:23:47,820
A part-part guy?!
You mean he's a freak?!

344
00:23:47,820 --> 00:23:50,030
Rubber Person

345
00:23:51,030 --> 00:23:54,400
I didn't hit anything vital,
but that's a pretty serious wound!

346
00:23:54,400 --> 00:23:55,490
I win!

347
00:23:55,490 --> 00:23:57,870
You're too much, Captain!

348
00:23:57,870 --> 00:24:01,460
Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!

349
00:24:02,230 --> 00:24:05,880
Crap! The tables have turned!

350
00:24:05,880 --> 00:24:09,790
If something isn't done quickly,
those two guys and I are dead!

351
00:24:11,130 --> 00:24:14,020
That one hurt a bit...

352
00:24:14,020 --> 00:24:22,940
Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!
Buggy! Buggy! Buggy!

353
00:24:22,940 --> 00:24:25,360
Stabbing him from behind is unfair,

354
00:24:25,360 --> 00:24:26,900
Big Nose!

355
00:24:31,160 --> 00:24:34,820
Y-You idiot! Don't call him that!

356
00:24:37,830 --> 00:24:43,290
Who's... got a big nose?!

357
00:24:44,330 --> 00:24:45,330
Luffy!

358
00:24:47,150 --> 00:24:48,290
Buggy!

359
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:52,900
Oh, I'm definitely kicking your ass!

360
00:24:56,970 --> 00:25:00,310
Kicking my ass? You're a real riot!

361
00:25:00,310 --> 00:25:03,400
All three of you
are gonna die here, you know!

362
00:25:03,970 --> 00:25:06,310
And just how will my ass
get kicked, pray tell?!

363
00:25:13,270 --> 00:25:15,530
It's no use... It's all over...

364
00:25:18,750 --> 00:25:20,430
I refuse to die!

365
00:25:21,320 --> 00:25:22,780
Run, Zoro!

366
00:25:22,780 --> 00:25:23,770
What?!

367
00:25:23,770 --> 00:25:26,970
Wait! He came here to save you!

368
00:25:26,970 --> 00:25:28,540
What are you gonna do?!

369
00:25:34,500 --> 00:25:35,470
Understood.

370
00:25:35,470 --> 00:25:40,220
Nothing makes sense anymore!
This is why I hate pirates!

371
00:25:40,220 --> 00:25:44,350
Impudent fool!
You're not going anywhere!

372
00:25:51,350 --> 00:25:56,410
How foolish! Your three-sword style
has no effect on...

373
00:25:56,410 --> 00:25:58,870
Hey! Listen when people are talking!

374
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:18,890
What the hell?!
The cannon's pointed this way!

375
00:26:18,890 --> 00:26:20,670
Hey! Light it!

376
00:26:20,670 --> 00:26:21,300
What?!

377
00:26:21,300 --> 00:26:22,360
Hurry!

378
00:26:22,360 --> 00:26:22,940
O-Okay!

379
00:26:23,940 --> 00:26:25,240
Wait, wait, wait!

380
00:26:25,240 --> 00:26:28,570
There's still a Special Buggy Ball in there!

381
00:26:32,270 --> 00:26:34,420
You lit it!

382
00:26:34,420 --> 00:26:39,160
Wait! No! Stop! Stop!

383
00:26:55,440 --> 00:26:58,010
Hey, Zoro. You're hurt, you know...

384
00:26:58,010 --> 00:27:00,760
Just shut up and stay in there!

385
00:27:00,760 --> 00:27:03,100
I'm gonna do things my way!

386
00:27:08,590 --> 00:27:11,100
Who is this guy?!

387
00:27:13,160 --> 00:27:16,110
Luffy... who is she?

388
00:27:16,110 --> 00:27:18,660
Oh, she's our navigator!

389
00:27:20,260 --> 00:27:23,540
Get serious! Who are you guys?!

390
00:27:23,960 --> 00:27:25,620
Move...

391
00:27:26,730 --> 00:27:27,960
You're in the way!

392
00:27:40,640 --> 00:27:42,730
Why would you go that far?

393
00:27:42,730 --> 00:27:44,640
You're a pirate!
